# TanStack Router

- File: `client/src/router.tsx` with `createRootRoute` + child routes
- Root layout wraps `AppShell` + `<Outlet />`
- Pages are route components under `pages/`
- Keep route tree typed; export `router` for `RouterProvider`
- Prefer path-based navigation; avoid ad-hoc window routing
